Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:18:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Dump: DumpPage is the page's container, the route shapes
 its props with toDumpPageProps

DumpScreen becomes DumpPage and provides DumpPageContext (capture,
captureError, loadMore): DumpComposer takes no props and DumpFeed drops
onLoadMore. The route's unwrapping of the first feed page and its
current-ISO-week fallback move into the pure adapter toDumpPageProps
(utils/dump.ts, unit-tested), which the dump scenarios run their fixtures
through too.

